Upstream git history is preserved in this repository; the upstream repository is configured as the
git remote "upstream". All Okanka-specific changes to upstream files are listed in PATCHES.md and are
marked in the source with "[okanka patch]". New files live mainly in okanka/, kaggle/, space/, tokenizer/,
tasks/customjson.py and data/identity_tr.jsonl. Okanka additions are released under the same MIT License.

The model weights produced by this code are trained completely from scratch (random initialization).
No pretrained model weights are used. Training data and their licenses are listed in DATA_LICENSES.md;
in particular, Turkish Wikipedia text is CC BY-SA (attribution: Wikipedia contributors) and FineWeb-2 is
ODC-By 1.0 (attribution: Hugging Face, FineWeb-2 authors; subject to Common Crawl Terms of Use).
